        Taxpayers who received an LT11 or Letter 1058 and need to verify their exact 30-day CDP appeal deadline.
      </li>
      <li class="lt11-who-item">
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="lt11-who-arrow">→</span>
        Seniors at risk of having 15% of their Social Security benefits levied under the Federal Payment Levy Program.
      </li>
      <li class="lt11-who-item">
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="lt11-who-arrow">→</span>
        Adult children or tax professionals helping a family member request a formal CDP hearing before the IRS Appeals Office.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

